  policyName: Women's Suffrage
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 236d39c6a2a834a47a41c477c7d84517, type: 3}
  description: Gives women equal political voting rights. Courts and officials must apply the principle in ordinary disputes, not merely proclaim it in constitutional language. Its chief benefits are more culture, faster policy-point generation and greater labor productivity.
